# Final Report

## Purpose

This section contains the final academic submission for the **Tanasiom Aegis Cyber Essentials Readiness Framework** project.

The report represents the culmination of the project's research, framework development, implementation, testing, evaluation, and critical reflection activities. It demonstrates how academic theory, industry standards, and practical cybersecurity methodologies were combined to develop a structured readiness framework aimed at supporting Small and Medium-Sized Enterprises (SMEs) in preparing for Cyber Essentials certification.

