## Framework Coverage

The report evaluates readiness against the five Cyber Essentials control areas:

### Firewalls and Internet Gateways

Assessment of network boundary protection and secure access controls.

### Secure Configuration

Review of system hardening, default settings, and secure deployment practices.

### User Access Control

Evaluation of user account management, privilege separation, and authentication controls.

### Malware Protection

Assessment of anti-malware controls, endpoint protection, and application security measures.

### Security Update Management

Review of patch management processes, vulnerability remediation, and update governance.

